@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor black
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
actor "患者" as P
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n牙医" as D
participant "<img:business-entity.png>\n牙科诊所管理系统" as S
P -> C : 提出缴费或预付费用
activate C
alt 结算实际诊疗费用
 C -> S : 查询已确认项目、账单及预付余额
 S --> C : 返回费用依据和应收余额
 opt 项目或价目有疑问
  C -> D : 核实实际项目及费用依据
  D --> C : 提供确认或更正依据
 end
else 预付后续费用
 C -> S : 查询患者及预付款余额
 S --> C : 返回余额和既有记录
end
C -> P : 核对本次金额、渠道及抵扣安排
P --> C : 确认并付款
C -> C : 清点现金或核实非现金到账
C -> S : 登记已核实付款及分配／预付用途
activate S
S -> S : 核对金额、余额与重复登记\n保存支付、抵扣及凭据关联
S --> C : 返回收款结果、未付及预付余额
deactivate S
C --> P : 交付凭据、找零及余额说明
deactivate C
@enduml
